      "text": "You wrote that changing \u2605 to \u2606 was needed \u201cto match the instruction.\u201d That attributes your edit to a supplied request. Where was that request actually made? Check the instruction you were following, not your own \u201cCorrected\u201d lines. If you cannot locate supporting wording, don\u2019t fill the gap with an imagined intention. Set the replacement lists aside and reassess that attribution against the available text."
