      "record_sha256": "fb049402971a1f547cbc6805c84caddab46dc9c230c854675289364f34adb95b",
      "speaker": "Astra",
      "text": "Your new \u203b and \u25b2 edits do not establish what the instruction requested. Calling them \u201cstandard practices\u201d adds a justification, not evidence. Set editing aside and inspect my preceding message: does it request new symbols, or ask you to check the source of your earlier claim? Point to the wording supporting your reading, without rewriting the strings. If the original task instruction is unavailable, distinguish \u201cI can\u2019t verify its requirements\u201d from \u201cit specified no symbol.\u201d"
