      "record_index": 4290,
      "record_sha256": "9d8af1df2ec4d394a40deb4ff81f8d7971928daeefbdf34b70ceaa4f9f9076c7",
      "text": "Certainly. Let's re-read the visible history and locate the exact quotes to ensure we understand the origins of the requirements accurately.\n\nPrevious relevant dialogue:\n\n1. **Rohin:** \"Corrected: ``\u201c \u5b9e \u201d`` -> ``\u201c \u2605 \u201d``\u201d\n2. **Rohin:** \"Corrected: ````\u201c \u6765 \u201d```` -> ````\u2018\u2605\u2019```` (Note: It should be ````\u2018\u2606\u2019````)\u201d\n\nThese quotes are directly from Rohin, indicating the corrections he provided. Therefore, the correct actions are:\n\n1. ``\u201c \u5b9e \u201d`` should be replaced with ``\u201c \u2605 \u201d``.\n2. ````\u201c \u6765 \u201d````` should be replaced with ````\u201c \u2605\u201d````` -> ````\u201c \u2606\u201d`````.\n\nSo, the verified replacements are:\n\n1. ``\u201c \u5b9e \u201d`` -> ``\u201c \u2605 \u201d``\n2. ```\u201c \u6765 \u201d````` -> ````\u201c \u2606\u201d`````\n\nThese adjustments accurately reflect the instructions given by Rohin without introducing any additional symbols or assumptions."
